# Enable cross-origin isolation for the (multithreaded) sherpa-onnx KWS wasm,
# which requires SharedArrayBuffer (pthreads). COEP `credentialless` permits
# no-cors cross-origin subresources (jsdelivr, huggingface) without them
# needing Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy headers. Cloudflare Pages and GitHub
# Pages both honor this file.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
